I just voted NO on Republicans' bill that does nothing to address the healthcare crisis they manufactured.

This bill will cause healthcare premiums to soar for millions of Americans.

@HouseDemocrats and I will continue to fight back and protect everyone's access to affordable healthcare.

Because of Republicans' unwillingness to address THEIR healthcare crisis, ACA tax credits will expire in 27 DAYS for tens of millions of Americans.

I signed onto @HouseDemocrats' discharge petition to extend the ACA tax credits for 3 years.

@HouseGOP need to step up and join us in protecting healthcare.

Republicans need to bring up @RepJeffries' discharge petition to force a vote on extending the ACA tax subsidies. 

@HouseDemocrats are fighting to protect affordable healthcare. There are over 31,000 constituents in CA-29 who will be affected if Republicans don’t take action NOW. 

Republicans drove our country into a healthcare crisis, and they continue to show they have no plan to get us out of it.

UPDATE: As I was debating on the House floor and fighting for YOUR healthcare, @RepJeffries' discharge petition to extend the ACA tax credits for 3 years just hit 218 signatures - which is the number needed to force a vote in the House of Representatives.

Republicans must bring the vote up NOW to protect healthcare for millions of Americans. 

@HouseDemocrats are ready to vote NOW.

Instead of voting to protect healthcare for millions of working Americans, @SpeakerJohnson is sending the House of Representatives home.

Millions of working Americans' premiums are set to skyrocket on January 1 – they do not have time to wait.

@HouseDemocrats and I are demanding a vote TODAY to protect healthcare extend the ACA tax credits for 3 years.
